{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708110/extras/24dbd761dea3c7fedd358376ce51fcc1.avif?t=1767032536\" width=1438 height=280 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action takes place in Medieval Europe. The game is completely historically not accurate. But you will have fun playing it, and that's what matters. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708110/extras/34722a16eea306fa7f36835707aaa8ed.avif?t=1767032536\" width=1438 height=280 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day brings a new choice. Lie, kill, help, poison. What will you do today? The game has many different endings. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708110/extras/1022e467da0808f1a91d35456f4969b0.avif?t=1767032536\" width=1438 height=280 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To break the curse, you will need to complete the characters' missions: sometimes it will be to accumulate money, sometimes to help with something, and sometimes to sacrifice all the townspeople. For the glory of the gods, of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take part in traditional medieval activities:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morning market!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poisoning the prince!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrificing townspeople to the glory of the gods!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much, much more...</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708110?t=1767032536","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708110/eaa0275639ead512cd10bd32065310885f95fa84/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767032536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708110/afc62fc19fec3ad80c062c5a9d43316997c32526/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767032536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708110/afc62fc19fec3ad80c062c5a9d43316997c32526/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767032536","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708110/extras/24dbd761dea3c7fedd358376ce51fcc1.avif?t=1767032536\" width=1438 height=280 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action takes place in Medieval Europe. The game is completely historically not accurate. But you will have fun playing it, and that's what matters. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708110/extras/34722a16eea306fa7f36835707aaa8ed.avif?t=1767032536\" width=1438 height=280 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day brings a new choice. Lie, kill, help, poison. What will you do today? The game has many different endings. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708110/extras/1022e467da0808f1a91d35456f4969b0.avif?t=1767032536\" width=1438 height=280 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To break the curse, you will need to complete the characters' missions: sometimes it will be to accumulate money, sometimes to help with something, and sometimes to sacrifice all the townspeople. For the glory of the gods, of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take part in traditional medieval activities:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morning market!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poisoning the prince!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrificing townspeople to the glory of the gods!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much, much more...</p></li></ul>","developers":["\u0421\u043b\u043e\u0431\u0456\u0434\u0441\u044c\u043a\u0438\u0439 \u0432\u0456\u0442\u0435\u0440"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708110/274d4ef436ed280da61245a4fb072fb331e897f7/header.jpg?t=1767032536","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  OS X 10.9<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8GHz Dual-Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 350 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708110/156856998/10f7eefd510cc3ce9bf8bd12d9733d026410f69f/1766529020/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766529240","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708110/156856998/10f7eefd510cc3ce9bf8bd12d9733d026410f69f/1766529020/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766529240","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708110/156856998/10f7eefd510cc3ce9bf8bd12d9733d026410f69f/1766529020/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766529240","id":257183170,"name":"Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257183170/cbc8c0c2af980b2b44df5484787896f82aa61039/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766529240"}],"name":"That Friday again","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"